E. Weight Function (Deterministic)

Owner weight by tokenId (Option A)

id == 0              → 1400
1–10                 → 1200
11–100               → 1000
101–1,000            → 800
1,001–10,000         → 640
10,001–100,000       → 512
100,001–1,000,000    → 410
Each further decade  → floor(prev × 4 / 5)

Implement via simple comparisons — no loops, no floats.

