G. Emission Update Function (Shared)

This function is called before any claim.

Pseudocode:

if emissionsStartBlock is none → return

currentBlock = block-height
elapsed = currentBlock - lastEmissionBlock
remaining = TOTAL-SUPPLY - totalEmitted

if elapsed == 0 or remaining == 0 → return

yearIndex = min(3, (currentBlock - emissionsStartBlock) / BLOCKS-PER-YEAR)
yearAllocation = [400M, 300M, 200M, 100M][yearIndex]
perBlockRate = yearAllocation / BLOCKS-PER-YEAR

emit = min(remaining, elapsed × perBlockRate)

ownerEmit = emit × OWNER-POOL-BPS / BPS-DENOM
participantEmit = emit × PARTICIPANT-POOL-BPS / BPS-DENOM

acc-owner-per-weight += ownerEmit / total-owner-weight
acc-participant-per-weight += participantEmit / total-participant-weight

total-emitted += emit
last-emission-block = currentBlock


