H. Owner Claim (Per Inscription)

(call update-emissions)

pending =
  inscriptionWeight[tokenId] ×
  (acc-owner-per-weight - inscriptionRewardDebt[tokenId])

transfer pending to current NFT owner

update inscriptionRewardDebt[tokenId]

Ownership is read directly from the NFT contract.

